<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Aviso de terceros — TeatroPlayer</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 50rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .crate { border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.75rem 0; }
  .crate h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 0.25rem; }
  .meta { color: #555; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  pre { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 0.75rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 0.8rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Aviso de terceros</h1>

<p>
  TeatroPlayer es software libre bajo <strong>GNU GPL v3.0</strong>. Este
  documento cumple el punto «incluir <code>LICENSES/</code> con las licencias de
  terceros» de <code>Docs/11-open-source-y-licencias.md</code>.
</p>

<p><strong>{{#each overview}}{{#each counts}}{{count}}{{/each}}{{/each}} dependencias.</strong></p>

{{#each overview}}
<h2>{{name}} {{version}}</h2>
<ul>
{{#each counts}}
  <li>{{../name}}: {{count}} ({{name}}{{#if licenses}} — {{#each licenses}}{{name}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}{{/if}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{/each}}

{{#each licenses}}
<div class="crate">
  <h2>{{#each used_by}}{{#if @first}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{/if}}{{/each}}</h2>
  <p class="meta">{{name}} ({{id}})</p>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</div>
{{/each}}

</body>
</html>
